---
description: Safety constraints for power-input, amplifier, driver and enclosure work
globs: "**/*.{c,cc,cpp,h,hpp,md,kicad_sch,kicad_pcb}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Apply `AGENTS.md` hardware safety rules. Unknown drivers start with G0; tweeters require verified HPF/limiter/mute (G2); barrel-jack polarity is verified with a meter before first power-up, and the 19 V adapter, the 5 V buck and the amplifier are first run from a current-limited bench supply into a dummy load (G1); BTL speaker negatives are not chassis ground. Do not replicate to four units until G0-G2 pass.
